abstract: "Code and locked models for the integrated EN (HVG-ElasticNet, single-age studies excluded) and PCA/EN (Version B-PCA-glmnet) mouse ovarian ageing clocks developed by study-grouped nested cross-validation, and for cell-type-specific metacell ElasticNet clocks on v2 cell labels (revised manuscript)."
